    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d323-a2">

                <pb facs="0445" n="325" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg325"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Dawson to
                        Mr. Michelena.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Santo
                                Domingo</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 29,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Confirming our conversation of yesterday, I
                    beg to say that the contract in regard to your collecting all the customs
                    revenue of the Republic, signed to-day on behalf of the Dominican Government by
                    the minister of finance, was drafted by me after receiving instructions from the
                    Government of the United States, that I have been authorized by my government to
                    approve the making of the same, and that I will use all the powers at my command
                    to see that your rights thereunder are faithfully observed.</p>
                <p>Referring to the payment of your interest and commissions, I have to say that I
                    approve of the verbal arrangement made by you with the minister of finance to
                    the effect that the collection of the, same be deferred for the time being and
                    the Dominican Government receive the full amount of $18,750 per week during the
                    present crisis in its affairs.</p>
                <p>Yours, respectfully,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">T. C. Dawson.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
